  "title": "Mixed-up interpretation of bgp.ext_com.type.auth",
  "description": "Per RFC4360, the IANA authority bit 0 of the Type field should be\ninterpreted as \"Allocated on First Come First Serve Basis\" and the\nbit 1 as \"Allocated on Standard Action, Early Allocation or\nExperimental Basis\".\n\nhttps://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4360#section-2\n\nCloses #18397",
